 one related skill and Assassin two, with no alignment condition printed. || RELATED: three Physical plus four others stored as count 7 with a floor of three Physical. Electrical Basic only is Basic Electronics. Mechanical except Robot or Aircraft is Robot Mechanics and Aircraft Mechanics. Pilot except Robot Elite and boats is stored as the Robot Combat Elite rows, the five Boat rows and the two Military boat rows. Science Math only is read as both Mathematics rows. Cowboy is printed None and left out; the book lists no Horsemanship category. || MONEY: 1D6x100 in cash stored (printed lD6x$100); the 3D6x100 of saleable or tradeable items is in GM Notes. || EQUIPMENT not stored as rows: camp stove, three gasoline cans, satchel, box of matches and the basic tools carried in the vehicle have no row. The armor choice offers this book''s five homespun M.D.C. rows. The vehicles (a motorcycle and a car, or a pick-up truck or jeep-type vehicle, with a 30,000 dollar improvement budget that cannot be kept as cash) are in GM Notes. || NOT STORED: few Sentinels live past 35; background."
